  npcAvatar: {fileID: 0}
  npcName: Soldier
  nodes:
  - id: soldier_start
    text: YOU THERE! Come here!
    choices:
    - label: Who, me?
      nextNodeID: soldier_sure
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: soldier_sure
    text: Yeah you! The entirety of this fort needs your assisstance!
    choices:
    - label: Okay... How can I help?
      nextNodeID: soldier_glad
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: I have no time
      nextNodeID: soldier_angry
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: soldier_angry
    text: 'You can'' just sail away like this! We defend this ocean and without your
      assisstance we are vulnerable! So what say you, comrade?! '
    choices:
    - label: Okay... How can I help?
      nextNodeID: soldier_glad
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: Leave
      nextNodeID: 
      actionsOnChoose:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e042ea431fc0410ab65ad4e53a6af14, type: 2}
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: soldier_glad
    text: "Your service will not be forgotten, our mechanics will give your boat
      some big ol' tweakin'. \nSo listen comrade: My incompetent troops dropped 3
      cannons in this strait during a training excercise. I need you to get them
      out of there!"
    choices:
    - label: Why not do it yourself?
      nextNodeID: soldier_ship
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: Won't cannons sink my boat?
      nextNodeID: soldier_no
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: soldier_ship
    text: Our entire armada left the port this morning and won't be back in days.
      Days where we and this whole region is mmore vulnerable. WE NEED THOSE CANNONS!
    choices:
    - label: Won't cannons sink my boat?
      nextNodeID: soldier_no
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: I'm in!
      nextNodeID: soldier_accept
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: soldier_no
    text: Nahhhhh, don't worry. My guess is that your boat has some gerat buoyancy
      (whoever is responsible for that)
    choices:
    - label: Why not do it yourself?
      nextNodeID: soldier_ship
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: I'm in!
      nextNodeID: soldier_accept
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: soldier_accept
    text: You are a model soldier. Get the thicket out of the way and you should
      be able to pick up those cannons. You'll manage. I'll have a talk with those
      clumsy troops again. Good Luck Comrade!
    choices:
    - label: Leave
      nextNodeID: 
      actionsOnChoose:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e042ea431fc0410ab65ad4e53a6af14, type: 2}
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0501846449583476b95a6936d9db7fed, type: 2}
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  startNodeID: soldier_start
